OL,3,GNEWSAWelsh first minister backs UK
OL,4,Aaction on West Bank settlements
OL,5,
OL,6,FFirst Minister Rhun ap Iorwerth has
OL,7,Fwelcomed the sanctions announced by the
OL,8,FUK government on illegal Israeli
OL,9,Fsettlements in the occupied West Bank.
OL,11,FThe UK government made the decision
OL,12,Fwhile accusing Israel's government of
OL,13,Fturning a blind eye to the "ethnic
OL,14,Fcleansing" of Palestinians by settlers.
OL,16,FAp Iorwerth said it was "good to see"
OL,17,Fthe UK part of an international
OL,18,Fcoalition putting "pressure" on the
OL,19,FIsraeli government.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
