OL,3,GNEWSAWelsh first minister backs UK
OL,4,Aaction on West Bank settlements
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe said the UK government under Sir
OL,7,FKeir Starmer had moved "far too slowly
OL,8,Fin its response to the illegal
OL,9,Factivities of the Israeli government".
